<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SPR Privacy Policy</title></head><body><main style="max-width:900px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;font:16px/1.6 system-ui"><h1>SPR Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Effective August 31, 2026</strong></p><h2>Information processed</h2><p>SPR may process account identity, tenant and organization data, software metadata, findings, evidence, audit records, billing metadata and information supplied through integrations.</p><h2>Use</h2><p>Information is used for authentication, tenant isolation, trust analysis, monitoring, governance, billing, security, support and reliability.</p><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>Supported tenants can configure retention policies and request workspace deletion. Immutable security, audit or evidentiary records may be retained when necessary to preserve integrity or meet legal obligations.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>SPR uses authentication, database row-level security, audit trails, rate limiting and security monitoring. No internet service can eliminate all risk.</p><h2>Requests</h2><p>Where applicable, supported privacy-management capabilities provide access, correction, deletion, portability and objection workflows.</p></main></body></html>